{'symbol': 'PANW', 'date': '2023-04-13 11:27:00', 'title': 'PALO ALTO NETWORKS NAMED A LEADER IN THE GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT FOR SSE', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., APRIL 13, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ACCORDING TO GARTNER®, A SINGLE-VENDOR SASE DELIVERS CONVERGED NETWORK AND SECURITY CAPABILITIES TO CONNECT AND SECURE DISTRIBUTED USERS, DEVICES AND LOCATIONS TO RESOURCES IN THE CLOUD, EDGE AND ON-PREMISES.1 THIS ENABLES ORGANIZATIONS TO MODERNIZE THEIR NETWORKING AND SECURITY TO ADDRESS THE NEEDS OF THEIR HYBRID WORKFORCE. PALO ALTO NETWORKS (NASDAQ: PANW), THE GLOBAL CYBERSECURITY LEADER, ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN THE 2023 GARTNER MAGIC QUADRANT™ FOR SECURITY SERVICE EDGE. THIS LATEST RECOGNITION MAKES PALO ALTO NETWORKS® THE ONLY CYBERSECURITY COMPANY RECOGNIZED AS A LEADER IN BOTH MAGIC QUADRANT REPORTS FOR SSE AND SD-WAN.'}